SRR5297328	PRJNA377313	SRP100861	SAMN06471252	SRX2599541	Mus musculus	Unsorted-plusDox-HAChIP-12hr-rep2	Unsorted-plusDox-HAChIP-12hr-rep2	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2515772: Unsorted-plusDox-HAChIP-12hr-rep2 Mus musculus ChIP-Seq	ChIP-Seq	GENOMIC	ChIP	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Cells were crosslinked in 1% formaldehyde for 10 minutes. Cells were then washed in PBS (x2) and resuspended in lysis buffer (10mM Tris,100mM NaCl, 1mM EDTA, 0.5mM EGTA, 0.1% Na-Deoxycholate, 0.5% N-lauroylsarcosine) to extract chromatin. Lysates were then sonicated using a BioRuptor, centrifuged to pellet cellular debris, and immunoprecipitated. After reversing crosslinks, libraries were prepped using the NEBnext DNA Library Prep Kit (NEB, E7370L). Adapter ligated DNA was size selected and purified using AMPure XP beads (Beckman Coulter, A63881) before sequencing.	41987783	10496945750	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR529/008/SRR5297328/SRR5297328_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR529/008/SRR5297328/SRR5297328_2.fastq.gz	74ffb9bb40b6781c0211d3c7f0ff51ca;e7a406393e01ce8b1ffbeb5ba7077821	3533611903;3558517547
